msgctxt "248"
msgid "(What should I ask about?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"(So Tamiya came up with the military expansion bill to lure\r\n"
"out an international arms smuggling syndicate known as Black\r\n"
"Monday.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"(Their leader, Andre Richardson, would no doubt be drawn in\r\n"
"by the BMD system they're proposing for Okinawa.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"(In other words, the only reason Tamiya was so insistent on\r\n"
"the military expansion was so he could stamp out Black\r\n"
"Monday once and for all.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"(He has to be working with someone, though. Someone with\r\n"
"connections to the U.S. Army. That person holds the key to\r\n"
"all of this.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"(Kazama-san had a brother this whole time... And not only\r\n"
"that, but he's an ex-cop and an active CIA agent, too? This\r\n"
"is all hard to believe.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"(Apparently Tamiya and Kazama-san's brother, Joji, are\r\n"
"working together on some kind of plan. But what is this\r\n"
"plan exactly? I need more information.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"(Apparently Toma joined up with Mine once he learned what\r\n"
"Tamiya was really after.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"(And now, Joji Kazama is trying to silence Toma before he can spill any of "
"Tamiya's secrets.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "(So it looks like I'll need to stop Joji.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"(But why did Toma join Mine in the first place? And what\r\n"
"does Mine have to do with the resort? I need to know more.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"(So the CIA needed the military expansion bill to stay\r\n"
"afloat so they could lure Black Monday out into the open.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"(And it was under CIA orders that Joji shot Daigo for\r\n"
"refusing to take my land.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"(Guess the CIA is almost like a second family to him now,\r\n"
"after what happened during his time on the force. That\r\n"
"explains why he's so loyal to the U.S. government.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"(Toma's been upfront all along about his desire to see the\r\n"
"resort deal succeed.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"(Then when he learned the military expansion bill was just\r\n"
"a front, he resigned from Tamiya's office and joined forces with Mine to "
"ensure the resort moved forward.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"(But by agreeing to help with the resort, Mine is going\r\n"
"against direct orders from Daigo. In other words, he's\r\n"
"betraying the clan.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"(I thought Mine respected Daigo, though. Why would he do something like "
"this...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"(So Tamiya and Joji Kazama, an agent with the CIA and the\r\n"
"younger brother of Shintaro Kazama, are working together to\r\n"
"bring down an arms smuggling syndicate called Black Monday.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"(But if that's the case, why did Kazama-san's brother shoot\r\n"
"Daigo? I need to know what the CIA is really after here.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "(What should I ask about?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"(So Kazama-san's brother and the CIA were promoting the\r\n"
"military expansion bill to destroy Black Monday, while Toma\r\n"
"and Mine were throwing their weight behind the resort...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "(I think I'm finally starting to see the whole picture here.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "The purpose of the military expansion bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "The man who shot Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "The favor Tamiya mentioned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "The purpose of the military expansion bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "The man who shot Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "The favor Tamiya mentioned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "The CIA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6928"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""